data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Hours and Directions — Nepenthe\nURL: https://www.nepenthe.com/directions-and-hours\n\nHours and Directions — Nepenthe\n\n## Nepenthe Restaurant - Open 365 days a year\n\nOpen daily for full service dining from 11:30am-10:00pm - Lunch 11:30 am - 4:30 pm and Dinner 5:00 pm to 10:00 pm Closed for dinner Thanksgiving and Christmas\n\n## Café Kevah \n\nOpen Daily 9:00am-3:00pm (weather permitting) Breakfast Served 9:00 am-12:00 pm — Lunch Served 9:00-2:30 —Beverages and Baked Goods 9:00 am-3:00 pm Closes for the Winter Season - Open President’s Weekend (mid-February) through the Sunday after New Year’s (weather permitting) \n\n## Phoenix Shop\n\nOpen Daily from 10:30 am-6:00 pm Closes at 5:00pm on Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Eve and Christmas Day Please visit our on-line shopping options here\n\n## Gift Certificates\n\nGift Certificates can be purchased through our website here. For Nepenthe and Café Kevah Gift Certificates - please click here. For Phoenix Gift Certificates - please call 831-667-2347 between 10:30 am-5:00 pm Gift Certificates are non-transferable between restaurants and gift shop.\n\n## Online Map\n\nClick here for a map of Big Sur using Google Maps\n\n## Directions and Maps for Visiting Nepenthe\n\nNepenthe is located on the Big Sur Coast with spectacular views of over 60 miles of the coast . Situated on the ocean side of Highway 1, our property is 29 miles South of Carmel and 63 miles North of San Simeon.\n\nBetween these two points, Highway 1 is a spectacular, scenic coastal highway. Our sign, driveway and parking area are directly adjacent to Highway 1. You can't miss us!\n\nVISITOR TIP: Although Big Sur is beautiful in the summer and the days are long, you'll be able to enjoy its majestic views, unencumbered trails and roads if you plan your visit for the off peak season from November to April. In addition, many hotels in the area may offer reduced winter rates.\n\nNepenthe 48510 Highway One - Big Sur - California - 93920 831.667.2345 Email Nepenthe (hello@example.test) - Email Phoenix (hello@example.test)","_meta":{"searchTime":13.65164399985224}}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1}

